(self.webpackChunksite=self.webpackChunksite||[]).push([[331],{3414:n=>{"use strict";n.exports=JSON.parse('{"slug":"dino-runner","title":"DINO RUNNER","authors":[{"name":"Gabriel Ortega","contact":null,"contactType":null,"contactUrl":null},{"name":"Vinicius Kondo","contact":null,"contactType":null,"contactUrl":null}],"date":1783641600000,"readme":"<p>A endless runner game inspired by the Chrome offline dinosaur game, built for the WASM-4 fantasy console.</p>\\n<h2>\ud83c\udfae About the Game</h2>\\n<p>Jump, duck, and dodge obstacles in this fast-paced retro-style runner! Control the dinosaur as it runs through a prehistoric landscape, avoiding cacti, rocks, and flying creatures. How far can you go?</p>\\n<h2>\ud83d\udd79\ufe0f Controls</h2>\\n<table>\\n<thead>\\n<tr>\\n<th>Key</th>\\n<th>Action</th>\\n</tr>\\n</thead>\\n<tbody>\\n<tr>\\n<td><strong>\u2191</strong> or <strong>Z</strong> or <strong>Space</strong></td>\\n<td>Jump (hold for higher jump)</td>\\n</tr>\\n<tr>\\n<td><strong>\u2193</strong></td>\\n<td>Duck (reduces hitbox)</td>\\n</tr>\\n<tr>\\n<td><strong>\u2191</strong> (Title Screen)</td>\\n<td>Start Game</td>\\n</tr>\\n<tr>\\n<td><strong>\u2191</strong> (Game Over)</td>\\n<td>Restart</td>\\n</tr>\\n</tbody>\\n</table>\\n<h2>\ud83e\udd95 Features</h2>\\n<ul>\\n<li><strong>3 Lives</strong>: You start with 3 lives. Each collision costs 1 life.</li>\\n<li><strong>Progressive Difficulty</strong>: Speed increases every 3 seconds, making obstacles appear more frequently.</li>\\n<li><strong>Dynamic Obstacles</strong>: 6 different types of obstacles including small/big/double cacti, rocks, pterodactyls, and birds.</li>\\n<li><strong>High Score</strong>: Your best score is saved during the session.</li>\\n<li><strong>Parallax Background</strong>: Mountains and clouds move at different speeds for depth effect.</li>\\n<li><strong>Dino Animation</strong>: Running, jumping, ducking, and surprised sprites.</li>\\n</ul>\\n<h2>\ud83d\udcca Scoring System</h2>\\n<table>\\n<thead>\\n<tr>\\n<th>Action</th>\\n<th>Points</th>\\n</tr>\\n</thead>\\n<tbody>\\n<tr>\\n<td>Dodge an obstacle</td>\\n<td>10 + (speed \xd7 2)</td>\\n</tr>\\n<tr>\\n<td>Survival bonus (every ~3 seconds)</td>\\n<td>+50 points</td>\\n</tr>\\n</tbody>\\n</table>\\n<h2>\ud83c\udfa8 Visual Style</h2>\\n<p>The game uses a custom Game Boy-inspired color palette:</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>White (#f8f8f8)</li>\\n<li>Light Green (#a0c070)</li>\\n<li>Medium Green (#407040)</li>\\n<li>Dark Green (#082018)</li>\\n</ul>\\n<h2>\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f Technical Details</h2>\\n<ul>\\n<li><strong>Platform</strong>: WASM-4 Fantasy Console</li>\\n<li><strong>Language</strong>: C</li>\\n<li><strong>Resolution</strong>: 160\xd7160 pixels</li>\\n<li><strong>Color Depth</strong>: 4 colors (1-bit sprites)</li>\\n<li><strong>Sprites</strong>: 8\xd78 and 8\xd712 pixel art</li>\\n</ul>\\n<h2>\ud83d\ude80 How to Play</h2>\\n<ol>\\n<li>Press <strong>x</strong> on the title screen to start</li>\\n<li>Press <strong>x</strong> to jump over ground obstacles</li>\\n<li>Press <strong>\u2193</strong> to duck under flying obstacles</li>\\n<li>Press <strong>x</strong> (hold) to jump higher</li>\\n<li>Survive as long as possible and beat your high score!</li>\\n</ol>\\n<h2>\ud83d\udc80 Game Over</h2>\\n<p>When you lose all 3 lives, the game ends. Your final score will be displayed and compared to your high score. Press <strong>\u2191</strong> to restart.</p>\\n<h2>\ud83d\udcdd Tips</h2>\\n<ul>\\n<li><strong>Hold the jump button</strong> to gain extra height!</li>\\n<li><strong>Duck</strong> to avoid birds and pterodactyls</li>\\n<li>The game speed increases gradually - stay alert!</li>\\n<li>Watch the pattern - sometimes obstacles spawn in pairs</li>\\n</ul>\\n<hr>\\n<p><em>Created with profissionalism using WASM-4</em></p>\\n<p><a href=\\"https://wasm4.org\\">Download WASM-4</a></p>"}')}}]);